13.	Weblogic Configuration console Level
______________________________________________________________________________



1.	Create user (webadmin/appdeployment/Monitoring) (Create new Machine by console)

a.	Logon to the console http://10.191.157.175:9001/rconsole
b.	Go to Security Data Tree => Realms => myrealm => Authentication Providers => DefaultAuthenticator
c.	Click on Users
d.	Click on Create and add user details

 

e.	Assign the roles to the user
 

f.	Login with newly created user (webadmin)

2.	Create Machine (nodemanager)

a.	Click on Edit Tree => Environment => Machines => Create
 

b.	Nodemanager Configuration 

 

c.	Change the nodemanager property 
a.	cd /Weblogic15c/user_projects/domains/unipaydomain/nodemanager
b.	vi nodemanager.properties
c.	Change SecureListener=true to SecureListener=false
d.	Change ListenAddress=localhost to ListenAddress=10.191.157.175
e.	Change ListenPort=5556 to ListenPort=5557

d.	Create Cluster and JVMs

a.	Click on Environment => Cluster => Create new and Commit Changes

 

b.	Click on Servers => Create
 

 

 

 

 

c.	Create JVM on Node 2 by cloning from the JVM of 1st node.

 

3.	Set Generic JVM arguments.
a.	Click on Environment => Servers 
b.	Click on JVM name
c.	Click on Advanced
d.	Click on Node Manager

 

4.	Set JVM arguments in 
a.	cd /Weblogic15c/user_projects/domains/unipaydomain/bin
b.	vi setDomainEnv.sh




On the 2nd Node, please execute Step 1 to 7. After completion of installation, please perform pack-unpack operation on 1st Node (on which AdminServer is installed)

1.	Logon to 1st node
2.	cd /Middleware15c/Oracle/Oracle_Home/oracle_common/common/bin
3.	./pack.sh -domain=/Weblogic15c/user_projects/domains/unipaydomain -template=/tmp/unipay_domain.jar -template_name="unipaydomain" -managed=true
4.	Copy the JAR file on 2nd Node
5.	cd /Middleware15c/Oracle/Oracle_Home/oracle_common/common/bin
6.	./unpack.sh -template=/tmp/unipay_domain.jar -domain=/Weblogic15c/user_projects/domains/unipaydomain
7.	Go to /Weblogic15c/user_projects/domains/unipaydomain/nodemanager
8.	vi nodemanager.properties
9.	Change ListenAddress=10.191.157.175 to ListenAddress=10.191.157.176.

