•	Save and commit the changes.
•	Restart admin server
•	Access the console using https://<IP Address>:9002/rconsole


SSL Configuration on Managed Server

•	Place the JKS file on server in /Weblogic15c/certificate.
•	Logon to Console
•	Go to Environment => AdminPortal1 => Security => Keystores and make the settings as per below: 

Change keystore type from dropdown the keystore:
Demo identity Demo Trust to Custom identity java standard trust.
 
•	Click on SSL tab and enter below mentioned settings
 

•	Save and commit the changes.
